# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore cho ban demo HF Spaces.
# LUU Y: Docker doc .dockerignore o GOC build context (goc repo), KHONG phai canh
# Dockerfile. Khi tao Space -> copy file nay thanh ".dockerignore" o goc repo/Space.
# Muc dich: build context gon + KHONG bao gio dua secret/PII/node_modules vao image.
# =============================================================================

# Dependencies & build output (Docker tu cai + build lai ben trong)
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
out
**/out
.swc
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Secrets & PII — TUYET DOI khong dua vao image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
**/secrets/
HỒ SƠ THÔNG TIN KHẢO SÁT KHÁCH HÀNG/
*.docx

# Prisma Client da generate o host (se generate LAI trong container theo engine Debian)
**/.prisma
**/generated

# Git / CI / editor / OS
.git
.gitignore
.github
.idea
.vscode
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude / worktrees / docs nang (khong can cho runtime demo)
.claude
docs/pdf
design
coverage
**/coverage
*.log
logs/

# Chinh cac file trien khai (khong can vao image; da COPY co chon loc trong Dockerfile)
deploy/hf-demo/README.md
deploy/hf-demo/README.space.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GOI KHACH: file nay CO Y khong loai `tenants/`, khac voi .dockerignore o goc repo.
#
# Ly do: image chinh (deploy/netviet) la ban CHUNG cho moi khach nen tuyet doi khong duoc mang goi
# khach nao; con Space nay la demo MOT khach, chay PERSISTENCE=memory va offline hoan toan, nen goi
# khach la nguon du lieu duy nhat — HF Space khong mount volume duoc.
#
# ⚠️ HE QUA CAN BIET: Space la CONG KHAI, ma tenants/ultty/data/knowledge.json chua gia si that,
# dieu khoan cong no cua tung dai ly va chat ID nhom Zalo that. Mo Space nay voi du lieu that =
# cong bo bang gia si cua khach. Truoc khi mo cong khai: hoac thay bang goi demo da lam sach so
# lieu, hoac co xac nhan cua khach. Xem docs/ke-hoach/nen-tang-da-khach.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
